From dfeda971bba5e3ecb2fb64464cb1571505a1c16c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Williams <kwilliam@gcc.gnu.org>
Date: Wed, 5 May 2010 15:58:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] st/cli-fe: GCC CLI Front End

https://gcc.gnu.org/projects/cli.html
----------------------------
From-SVN: r159070

st/cli-fe: remove debug print from passes.c

From-SVN: r159104

st/cli-fe: remove redundant calls to cgraph_finalize_compilation_unit and cgraph_optimize

From-SVN: r159264

cli-fe: add gcc4net support functions

From-SVN: r160532

cli-fe: change file structure of libcilsupport

From-SVN: r160537

cil-fe: fix libcilsupport configure file

From-SVN: r160544

cli-fe: fix configure.ac in libcilsupport

From-SVN: r160605

cli-fe: fix argc bug

From-SVN: r160831

cli-fe: cli reference type bug fix

From-SVN: r160885

cli-fe: added little/big endian support to cil parser

From-SVN: r161593

Fixed bug in paser_emit_switch(). Previously emited SWITCH_EXPR was dropped by gimplifier. Now switchs are emited as nests of if-then-else.

From-SVN: r169791

Fixed "FIXME" in parser_emit_ldsflda(). Now, pointer type depends on the field properties.

From-SVN: r169795

Implemented STIND_I8 and LDIND_I8

From-SVN: r169829

Two new flags, -fcil-use-libstd and -fcil-use-libstd-builtins, enabled by default. Calls to libstd are prepended by Libstd (ready to link against libstd.so)

From-SVN: r170183

Fixed parser_emit_ldarga(), mark addressable the variable

From-SVN: r170648

Variadic arguments implemented in GCIL

From-SVN: r173852

Fixed endianness problems in Sparc

From-SVN: r175221
